<title>SWITZERLAND: TABLE-Roche 1997 H1 sales up 20 percent.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Roche 1997 H1 sales up 20 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group sales		    9,302	     vs 7,769</p>
<p>Note - Full name of Swiss pharmaceuticals group is Roche Holding AG. Sales rose 20 percent in Swiss franc terms, six percent in local currency terms. Divisional growth accelerated sharply during the second quarter, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
